{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56873","headline":"道州民爲刺史薛伯高毁鼻亭神歌（题拟） · 佚名","name":"道州民爲刺史薛伯高毁鼻亭神歌（题拟）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"我有耉老，公燠其饥。\n我有病癃，公起其羸。\n髫童之嚣，公实智之，鳏孤孔艰，公实遂之。\n孰尊恶德，远矣自古。\n孰羡（一作「恣」）淫昏，俾我斯瞽。\n千岁之冥，公辟其户。\n我子洎孙。\n（见柳宗元《柳河东集》卷二八《道州毁鼻亭神记》引）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"佚名","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56873.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56873","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}